{"id":"vod_sn_36084","vodId":"36084","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"迷茫管家与懦弱的我","name_cn":"迷茫管家与懦弱的我","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1bba2a4e9c15a264c1e915ce547600b6.jpg"},"summary":"近卫昂（井口裕香 配音）家世世代代都作为凉月家的管家而存在，以此与凉月家族形成了深厚的羁绊。可是，管家的职位只能由男子担当，为了延续祖先的传统，近卫昂女扮男装隐藏身份，成为了大小姐凉月奏（喜多村英梨 配音）的管家。　　坂町近次郎是一个普通的男生，由于童年的遭遇，长大后的次郎开始变得无法从容的面对女性，这一现象一般被称为“女性恐惧症”。由于这种特质，次郎发现了近卫昂的秘密，为了掩盖事实，凉月奏以治疗其恐惧症为条件，要求次郎保守这个秘密。从此，在害怕女性的次郎身边，开始出没大量外形可爱性格活泼的女生，次郎快乐的校园生活正式开始！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:40:13","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/sQ0Vcj0WLM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/mGnPkGwEfr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/cv2tEkEzFV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/qwAktWJ9SG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ci1y0td1M41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/XgvGnkCN9A1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/0npahrSppc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/wx1QuG5GHt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/VTtpNT3Csr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/h63dDxFQ191/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/aQBhgRKWqZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/qhnujvH3BW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CCDdARu8sW1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:27.316Z"}